A descendant comment span closes between its own column and its item's

```
- a

  [^n]: %%%
  %%%
  c
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <p>c</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a

  [^n]: %%%
%%%
    c
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - %%%

  %%%
  c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li></li>
    </ul>
    c
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  - b
    :: u
    : %%%

  %%%
  c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <ul>
      <li>b
        <dl>
          <dt>u</dt>
          <dd></dd>
        </dl>
      </li>
    </ul>
    c
  </li>
</ul>
```
